  "name": "LMN PANEL (SMN1 & SMN2) DELETION DUPLICATION BY NGS",
  "code": "2427",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"1193\">\n<li data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"994\">\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"994\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"840\">SMN1 Gene Deletion:</strong> Deletion of exon 7 in <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"871\">SMN1</strong> is the primary cause of <strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"929\">Spinal Muscular Atrophy (SMA)</strong>. Homozygous deletion = <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"965\">affected</strong>; heterozygous = <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"993\">carrier</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1101\">\n<p data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1101\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1018\">SMN2 Copy Number:</strong> Modifies severity in affected individuals. More copies = milder disease phenotype.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1193\">\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1193\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1121\">Clinical Use:</strong> Diagnosis of SMA, carrier screening, and prenatal/postnatal evaluation.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<p data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1348\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1217\">Normal Result:</strong> 2 copies of SMN1 gene indicates non-carrier.</span><br data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1265\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1282\">Carrier:</strong> 1 copy of SMN1.</span><br data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1301\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1325\">Affected (SMA):</strong> 0 copies of SMN1 gene.</span></p>\n</blockquote>",
